<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>TWZ</title><link>https://www.twz.com</link><description>防御世界的强大进攻。</description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 20:47:04 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>独特的 AIM-9X 响尾蛇现在出现在中东的美国空军 F-35A 上</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/unique-aim-9x-sidewinders-now-seen-on-usaf-f-35as-in-the-middle-east</link><description>&lt;p&gt;为什么现在出现这些 AIM-9X 仍是一个谜，但降低雷达反射率的 F-35 专用版本的工作仍在继续。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/unique-aim-9x-sidewinders-now-seen-on-usaf-f-35as-in-the-middle-east"&gt;中东地区美国空军 F-35A 上出现的独特 AIM-9X 响尾蛇战斗机&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 20:28:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/unique-aim-9x-sidewinders-now-seen-on-usaf-f-35as-in-the-middle-east</guid></item><item><title>欧洲押注CV90装甲战车</title><link>https://www.twz.com/land/europe-bets-big-on-cv90-armored-fighting-vehicle</link><description>&lt;p&gt;五个欧洲北约盟国共同订购了 400 多辆 CV90 步兵战车，交易金额达 60 亿美元。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/land/europe-bets-big-on-cv90-armored-fighting-vehicle"&gt;欧洲在 CV90 装甲战车上押下重注的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:57:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/land/europe-bets-big-on-cv90-armored-fighting-vehicle</guid></item><item><title>穿上这款全新升级的隐形圣诞树 T 恤，潜入烟囱而不被发现</title><link>https://www.twz.com/uncategorized/sneak-down-the-chimney-undetected-in-this-newly-upgraded-very-stealthy-christmas-tree-t-shirt</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我们将推出广受欢迎的 Silent Night T 恤的新款式，以及其他三款重新发行的节日 T 恤，颜色为新颜色！&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/uncategorized/sneak-down-the-chimney-undetected-in-this-newly-upgraded-very-stealthy-christmas-tree-t-shirt"&gt;穿着这件新升级的隐形圣诞树 T 恤潜入烟囱而不被发现的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:54:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/uncategorized/sneak-down-the-chimney-undetected-in-this-newly-upgraded-very-stealthy-christmas-tree-t-shirt</guid></item><item><title>地堡谈话：享受神奇的火鸡日版！</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-have-a-magical-turkey-day-edition</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我们还有最后一罐蔓越莓酱......&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-have-a-magical-turkey-day-edition"&gt;地堡后谈话：度过一个神奇的火鸡日版！&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:26:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-have-a-magical-turkey-day-edition</guid></item><item><title>无人机威胁促使英国皇家空军在基地安装防护网以保护飞机：报告</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/drone-threats-prompt-raf-to-install-netting-at-bases-to-protect-aircraft-reports</link><description>&lt;p&gt;由于美国及其盟国越来越担心无人机对停放的飞机造成危险，因此安装了这种防护网。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/drone-threats-prompt-raf-to-install-netting-at-bases-to-protect-aircraft-reports"&gt;无人机威胁促使英国皇家空军在基地安装防护网以保护飞机：报告&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:47:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/drone-threats-prompt-raf-to-install-netting-at-bases-to-protect-aircraft-reports</guid></item><item><title>美国空军根据与波音公司的原始合同订购了最后一批 KC-46 加油机</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/final-kc-46-tankers-under-original-contract-with-boeing-ordered-by-usaf</link><description>&lt;p&gt;由于不确定性影响其下一代空中加油愿景，美国空军计划最终在已订购的 188 架基础上再购买 75 架 KC-46。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/final-kc-46-tankers-under-original-contract-with-boeing-ordered-by-usaf"&gt;美国空军与波音公司订购的最终 KC-46 加油机最终合同&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:28:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/final-kc-46-tankers-under-original-contract-with-boeing-ordered-by-usaf</guid></item><item><title>ARRW高超音速导弹变型舰艇杀伤力极强，难以获得立法者的全力支持</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/ship-killing-arrw-hypersonic-missile-variant-struggling-to-get-full-support-from-lawmakers</link><description>&lt;p&gt;参议员们还计划削减新的空射弹道导弹计划的资金投入。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/ship-killing-arrw-hypersonic-missile-variant-struggling-to-get-full-support-from-lawmakers"&gt;杀舰后的 ARRW 高超音速导弹变体努力获得立法者的全力支持，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:04:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/ship-killing-arrw-hypersonic-missile-variant-struggling-to-get-full-support-from-lawmakers</guid></item><item><title>新型 W8000 助力中国货运无人机不断发展壮大</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/chinas-cargo-drones-keep-getting-bigger-with-new-w8000</link><description>&lt;p&gt;随着中国推进新型自主空运，白鲸航空最新的无人驾驶货机是迄今为止最大的，目标是运输八吨货物。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;文章&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/chinas-cargo-drones-keep-getting-bigger-with-new-w8000"&gt;《中国货运无人机凭借新型 W8000 不断变大》&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:50:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/chinas-cargo-drones-keep-getting-bigger-with-new-w8000</guid></item><item><title>新抵达乌克兰的山猫KF41战车将承担反无人机任务</title><link>https://www.twz.com/land/lynx-kf41-fighting-vehicles-newly-arrived-in-ukraine-will-take-on-counter-drone-mission</link><description>&lt;p&gt;德国制造的车辆抵达乌克兰时，装甲的作用已大大减弱，但并未消除。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;最新抵达&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;乌克兰&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/land/lynx-kf41-fighting-vehicles-newly-arrived-in-ukraine-will-take-on-counter-drone-mission"&gt;的山猫 KF41 战车将承担反无人机任务&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:39:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/land/lynx-kf41-fighting-vehicles-newly-arrived-in-ukraine-will-take-on-counter-drone-mission</guid></item><item><title>俄罗斯战机几秒钟内就进入韩国领空，首尔紧急升空 F-15K</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/seoul-scrambles-f-15ks-as-russian-warplanes-come-within-seconds-of-crossing-into-south-korean-airspace</link><description>&lt;p&gt;俄罗斯 Tu-160 和护航战斗机​​的出现引发了韩国居民的避难令。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/seoul-scrambles-f-15ks-as-russian-warplanes-come-within-seconds-of-crossing-into-south-korean-airspace"&gt;当俄罗斯战机在几秒钟内进入韩国领空时，首尔紧急升空 F-15K 的&lt;/a&gt;报道首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:24:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/seoul-scrambles-f-15ks-as-russian-warplanes-come-within-seconds-of-crossing-into-south-korean-airspace</guid></item></channel></rss>